	(text "The isolated 5 V is unregulated (5 V x 1.1 minus one Schottky drop): 4.8-5.5 V over a 5 V +/-5 % input, inside the 4.5-5.5 V VCC2 window of ISO1042. R preload keeps it bounded at no load."
